@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Listado -> publico (es el catalogo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/places

### Detalle -> publico
GET {{baseUrl}}/places/1

### Crear -> ORGANISER o ADMIN
# NO lleva id_user: el dueno sale del token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teatro Real", "capacity": 500,
  "description": "Sala principal",
  "province": "Santa Fe", "city": "Rosario",
  "street": "San Martin", "street_number": "123", "zip_code": "2000"
}

### Editar -> solo el dueno (403 si es de otro)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/places/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Teatro Real - Sala A" }

### Bajar el aforo por debajo de un evento programado -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/places/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "capacity": 1 }

### Eliminar -> solo el dueno
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/places/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
